WEBVTT

00:08:59.476 --> 00:09:02.877
they're demanding
educational institutions,

00:09:02.901 --> 00:09:04.401
they're demanding governments

00:09:04.425 --> 00:09:09.342
where sexism and sexual harassment
and sexual assault are neither accepted

00:09:09.366 --> 00:09:10.825
nor tolerated.

00:09:10.849 --> 00:09:12.597
Women around the world, as we know,

00:09:12.621 --> 00:09:15.748
are raising their hands
and saying, "Me Too,"

00:09:15.772 --> 00:09:18.419
and it's a movement
that's made so much more powerful

00:09:18.443 --> 00:09:21.751
by the fact that women
are standing together across industries,

00:09:21.775 --> 00:09:25.743
from domestic workers
to celebrities in Hollywood.

00:09:26.417 --> 00:09:29.530
Women are marching, we're sitting in,

00:09:29.554 --> 00:09:30.844
we're speaking up.